    "group": "Cabal of Chaos",
    "summary": "During your Shooting phase: if a HERETIC ASTARTES PSYKER unit of yours (DAEMON units excluded) makes a Dark Pact upon being picked to shoot, its ranged attacks get +1 Strength. During any Fight phase: if one of your HERETIC ASTARTES DAEMON PRINCE or DAEMON PRINCE WITH WINGS units (KHORNE units excluded) makes a Dark Pact upon being picked to fight, its melee attacks get +2 Strength and +1 Armour Penetration. Both bonuses last for the rest of that phase.",
